---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'; import {site} from '../config';
---
<Base title="About"><div class="container page"><div class="page-heading"><div class="eyebrow">A LITTLE ABOUT ME</div><h1>Curiosity is a <em>good place to start.</em></h1><p>{site.bio}</p></div><div class="about-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">THE PERSON BEHIND THE PAGE</div><h2>Hi, I’m Yash<span class="accent">.</span></h2><p>{site.bio}</p><p>I believe that understanding the “why” behind a system is as important as knowing how to build it. Writing things down helps me make those connections and share them with others.</p><h3>My journey</h3><p>{site.journey}</p><h3>Engineering philosophy</h3><p>Stay curious. Prefer clear solutions. Understand the trade-offs, make ideas observable, and keep learning in public.</p><h3>Get in touch</h3><p>Find me on <a href={site.github}>GitHub</a>{site.linkedin && <> or <a href={site.linkedin}>LinkedIn</a></>}{site.email && <> or <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>email</a></>}.</p>{site.resume && <a class="button primary" href={site.resume} download>Download resume ↓</a>}</div><aside><div class="eyebrow">AREAS OF INTEREST</div><div class="skill-list">{site.skills.map((s,i)=><div><span>0{i+1}</span>{s}<b>↗</b></div>)}</div><p class="muted">A growing list, never a finished one.</p></aside></div></div></Base>
